Rolln"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/o7YRAcJ87j", "end": 224, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JoshWest247/status/2120290538331287895/video/1", "media_key": "13_2120290320478855168", "start": 201, "url": "https://t.co/o7YRAcJ87j"}]}, "id": "2120290538331287895", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2903, "like_count": 44, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Neuralink Patient 22 shares his regrets on getting his brain computer interface implant. \n\nI sat down with @DeadManRolln and he shared his incredible story. \n\nWatch on JoshWest247 YT 📺 \nLink Below: ⬇️ https://t.co/o7YRAcJ87j", "url": "https://x.com/JoshWest247/status/2120290538331287895"}, {"author_id": "8963722", "created_at": "2026-11-12T16:09:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120911895284924490"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "After its latest device failed to perform, brain-computer interface startup Synchon halted clinical trials. The company says it will upgrade the implant’s hardware and is at work on a new device.", "display_url": "wired.com/story/synchron…", "end": 219, "expanded_url": "https://www.wired.com/story/synchron-pauses-trials-of-its-brain-implant-due-to-performance-issues/?utm_brand=wired-science&utm_campaign=aud-dev&utm_medium=social&utm_social-type=owned&utm_source=twitter-science", "images": [{"height": 670, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120909310213378048/XnPRlf1D?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120909310213378048/XnPRlf1D?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 196, "status": 200, "title": "Synchron Pauses Trials of Its Brain Implant Due to Performance Issues", "unwound_url": "https://www.wired.com/story/synchron-pauses-trials-of-its-brain-implant-due-to-performance-issues/?utm_brand=wired-science&utm_campaign=aud-dev&utm_medium=social&utm_social-type=owned&utm_source=twitter-science", "url": "https://t.co/EYPIlWNd6Q"}]}, "id": 